abstract: >-
  Reproducible analysis code, configuration, and selected derived data
  supporting a donor-anchored aplastic-anemia study that integrates traceable
  candidate provenance, CD34+ hematopoietic transcriptomics, bone-marrow
  single-cell context, bidirectional Geneformer perturbation,
  regulatory-network analysis, docking, and standardized molecular dynamics.
  Release v0.1.0 is archived by Zenodo; later default-branch maintenance does
  not alter the archived tag, files, or DOI.
